<div class="space-y-6">
  <h1>Architecture</h1>
  <%= render "docs/nav" %>

  <div class="card space-y-4">
    <h3>Layer Diagram</h3>
    <pre><code>┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            BOUNDARY LAYER               │
│  Controllers, Jobs                      │
│  (receive input, delegate to services)  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           SERVICE LAYER                 │
│  QuotesImporter, QuotesCsvParser        │
│  (business logic, isolated, testable)   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            MODEL LAYER                  │
│  Quote, Customer, Supplier, Region      │
│  (database access, validations, scopes) │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            DATABASE LAYER               │
│  PostgreSQL — constraints, indexes      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘</code></pre>
  </div>

  <div class="card space-y-4">
    <h3>Key Principles</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-2">
      <li><strong>Business logic in services, not models.</strong> QuotesImporter owns the import lifecycle. Quote model has scopes and validations only.</li>
      <li><strong>Jobs are thin boundary classes.</strong> ImportQuotesJob is 9 lines — finds the import, delegates to QuotesImporter.</li>
      <li><strong>Database constraints enforce correctness.</strong> NOT NULL, foreign keys, composite unique indexes. Validations are for UX.</li>
      <li><strong>Streaming for large files.</strong> CSV.foreach processes line-by-line. Memory stays flat for 500MB+ files.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card space-y-4">
    <h3>Service Classes</h3>
    <table class="table">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-(--divider-color) text-left">
          <th>Class</th>
          <th>Responsibility</th>
          <th>Pattern</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="border-b border-(--base-border-tertiary)">
          <td><code>QuotesImporter</code></td>
          <td>Orchestrates import: finds Import, opens file, batches, upserts, manages status</td>
          <td>ThingDoer / do_thing</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-(--base-border-tertiary)">
          <td><code>QuotesCsvParser</code></td>
          <td>Validates file, parses rows, yields attributes or errors</td>
          <td>Stateless, no ActiveRecord</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>
